+-------------------+     +-------------------+     +-------------------+
|   mousePressed    |     |   mouseDragged    |     |   mouseReleased   |
|                   |     |                   |     |                   |
|    did I grab     |     |    the circle     |     |   is it inside    |
|    the circle?    |     | follows the mouse |     |    the target?    |
+---------+---------+     +---------+---------+     +---------+---------+
          |                         ^                         |
          |  "sets it true"         |  "only reads it"        |  "sets it false"
          v                         |                         v
----------+-------------------------+-------------------------+-----------> isDragging
